{"ref":"BDB, גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת","hw":"גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. skull, head, poll</strong> (person) <strong>(</strong>Ba<sup>NB 205</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּלְגַּלְתָּא</span>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جُمْجُمَة</span> <strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.35\">2 K 9:35</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלְגָּלְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:53\" href=\"/Judges.9.53\">Ju 9:53</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.10\">1 Ch 10:10</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלְגְּלֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:2\" href=\"/Numbers.1.2\">Nu 1:2</a> + 5 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>skull</em>, as broken by a stone <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:53\" href=\"/Judges.9.53\">Ju 9:53</a>; as severed from body <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.35\">2 K 9:35</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.10\">1 Ch 10:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>head, poll</em> (in counting, taxing, etc.; only P and late) <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹמֶר לַגּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:16\" href=\"/Exodus.16.16\">Ex 16:16</a> <em>an omer for every man;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:26\" href=\"/Exodus.38.26\">38:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:2\" href=\"/Numbers.1.2\">Nu 1:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:18\" href=\"/Numbers.1.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:20\" href=\"/Numbers.1.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:22\" href=\"/Numbers.1.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:47\" href=\"/Numbers.3.47\">3:47</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.3\">1 Ch 23:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.24\">24</a>.","next":"BDB, מְגִלָּה","prev":"BDB, גִּלְגָּל²"}